OL,3,GNEWSA'My leukaemia was caused by years 
OL,4,Aof unnecessary chemotherapy'           
OL,6,FA man who developed leukaemia after    
OL,7,Ftaking chemotherapy tablets for a brain
OL,8,Ftumour for almost 13 years says he     
OL,9,Ffeels betrayed by those responsible for
OL,10,Fhis care.                              
OL,12,FMark Callaghan was prescribed          
OL,13,Ftemozolomide at University Hospitals   
OL,14,FCoventry and Warwickshire (UHCW) for   
OL,15,Fmore than 12 years longer than NHS     
OL,16,Fguidance typically recommends.         
OL,18,FHe said neither consultant Prof Ian    
OL,19,FBrown nor clinical nurse specialist Ian
OL,20,FEdwards warned him that leukaemia was a
OL,21,Fpotential side effect of the treatment.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
