OL,3,GNEWSA'My leukaemia was caused by years 
OL,4,Aof unnecessary chemotherapy'           
OL,6,FThe trust is reviewing the care of     
OL,7,Fhundreds of patients treated by Brown  
OL,8,Fafter concerns many were given years of
OL,9,Funnecessary chemotherapy and has issued
OL,10,Fan apology to patients and their       
OL,11,Ffamilies.                              
